%% Provider configuration version — maker-checker
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT : maker creates / clones
  DRAFT --> DRAFT : edit (optimistic lock)
  DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL : validate + dry-run pass, submit (content_hash frozen)
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : checker rejects (reason)
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED : checker ≠ maker, step-up MFA, approves exact content_hash
  REJECTED --> [*]
  APPROVED --> ACTIVE : effective_from reached
  ACTIVE --> SUPERSEDED : newer version becomes ACTIVE
  SUPERSEDED --> ACTIVE : rollback (approved)
  SUPERSEDED --> [*]
